# Quest for Ancient Secrets: the ability needs exactly five counters and targets any player. Thought Scour on Bot1 (three
# counters: two milled cards and the spell) draws a second Thought Scour, which is cast on Bot2 twice: Bot2's milled
# cards are no cards put into Bot1's graveyard, so each cast is one counter, four after the first (refused: too few) and
# five after the second. Activated targeting Bot2, the four Mountains Bot2 has in its graveyard are shuffled into its
# library (27 - 7 = 20 cards again) and Bot1's own graveyard, Quest on top, is left alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Quest for Ancient Secrets
Thought Scour
Thought Scour
Island
Island
Thought Scour
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x27

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Quest for Ancient Secrets.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Accept
? Bot1.Battlefield.Quest for Ancient Secrets.Counters.Quest = 4
! Bot1.Battlefield.Quest for Ancient Secrets.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Accept
? Bot1.Battlefield.Quest for Ancient Secrets.Counters.Quest = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Quest for Ancient Secrets.Activate(Bot2)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Library.Count = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Quest for Ancient Secrets; Thought Scour; Thought Scour; Thought Scour; Island; Island
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Sapphire; Mox Sapphire; Mox Sapphire
